  "details": "Description\n\nthere was absolutely NO reason to remove this feature! Bring it back, many people have very special characters in their name.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nNow it is IMPOSSIBLE to add anyone with those cringey tiki torches or the crosses. I also need to pre blobck harrasser my friends tell me about.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1953-d52354d5be-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-27_22-20-18.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_c900a9d1-4faa-4f46-9104-839d1cd69452/1/file)",
